// The orb module's public surface.
//
// This is the dynamic-import boundary. Everything reachable from here, the
// 35 KB shader included, is code-split out of the main bundle by tsup and is
// only fetched when a project has actually turned the orb on. A developer using
// the DOM waveform downloads none of it.
//
// Nothing in here may be imported statically from VoxideWidget or VoxideClient
// or that guarantee is lost.

